OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANebula image wins Royal
OL,4,AObservatory competition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Observatory Greenwich has
OL,7,Fannounced the winner of its Astronomy
OL,8,FPhotographer of the Year competition
OL,9,Ffor an image of the Shark Nebula.
OL,11,FThe dark nebula is made from
OL,12,Finterstellar dust dense enough to block
OL,13,Fstarlight and is 650 light years away.
OL,15,FSteve Marsh, one of the judges and art
OL,16,Feditor at BBC Sky at Night Magazine,
OL,17,Fsaid the image by Ali Alobaidly showed
OL,18,F"flawless presentation, pin-sharp
OL,19,Fdetails and dynamic contrast".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
