OL,3,GNEWSANebula image wins Royal
OL,4,AObservatory competition
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "The Shark Nebula is already
OL,7,Fa striking object, but when it is
OL,8,Fresolved to the point where even
OL,9,Fdetail-rich distant galaxies can be
OL,10,Fseen through it, you know you're
OL,11,Flooking at something very special."
